## For Single Fathers Using Eternaldad

This license exists so that:
- You can take any system in this repository and use it in your household
- You can modify any system to fit your specific situation
- You can share what you learn with other single fathers
- You can build products or services based on these systems
- You must credit Mwebe Morgan and Eternaldad if you do

**The systems are yours to use. Share them forward.**

