## For Developers

The Eternaldad codebase (if any) is MIT licensed. You can fork this repository, modify it, and use it for your own purposes.

If you build something valuable from it, consider:
- Contributing back to the original repository
- Crediting the original work
- Sharing how your version helps single fathers

